# Schema changes

## Required behavior

- Prefer additive, reversible changes when the project expects `down()` / rollback.
- Name migrations clearly; one logical change set per migration when practical.
- Coordinate Table schema caches / bake regeneration only as the project already does.
- Never put secrets into seed/migration files committed to git.

## Anti-patterns

- Destructive column drops without a rollout plan
- Committing environment credentials in seeds
